{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hunter\u2019s Hand</i></strong> is a <strong>turn-based tactical roguelike deckbuilder</strong> set in a dark fantasy world slowly coming apart at the seams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hunter you travel across corrupted lands, uncovering clues and building a deck capable of confronting the ancient forces stirring beneath the surface. Each run unfolds across branching paths filled with combat encounters, strange events, and relics that reshape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising <strong>Threat</strong> draws the attention of something far older than the lands you walk through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/4f4338fcbf8cda368dfc490e07da1da6.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/4f4338fcbf8cda368dfc490e07da1da6.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/4f4338fcbf8cda368dfc490e07da1da6.mp4?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunter\u2019s Hand is built around deliberate, combo-driven combat where the order of your cards can determine survival. Manage your resources, chain abilities together, and adapt your deck to survive increasingly dangerous encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/066fc8769d76d4be0e97ffe1c264e765.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/066fc8769d76d4be0e97ffe1c264e765.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/066fc8769d76d4be0e97ffe1c264e765.mp4?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck during each run using a wide pool of cards and relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New combinations emerge as you experiment with different strategies, allowing each playthrough to evolve in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/e4fb7cfe73c7255a476e3f0426e8d0c2.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/e4fb7cfe73c7255a476e3f0426e8d0c2.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/e4fb7cfe73c7255a476e3f0426e8d0c2.mp4?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Branching Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across procedurally generated maps where every path presents different risks and opportunities. Choose carefully between battles, events, and hidden encounters as you prepare for what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/3dd30ed46680900a2eae17d28f0a8594.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/3dd30ed46680900a2eae17d28f0a8594.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/3dd30ed46680900a2eae17d28f0a8594.mp4?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Threat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues discovered during your journey increase the world\u2019s <strong>Threat level</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push too far and the Ancient will reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it does, you must be ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/1ba15fb8cf86fad6ba7ed03b97c670f4.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/1ba15fb8cf86fad6ba7ed03b97c670f4.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Fantasy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore corrupted regions where ancient forces have begun to seep into the world. Each biome introduces new enemies, relics, and challenges as the hunt grows more dangerous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable classes and subclasses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large card and relic pools with evolving strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several biomes with unique enemies and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Ancient boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta progression and unlockable content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulty modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily runs and challenges</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Hunt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>Hunter\u2019s Hand</strong> to follow development and prepare for the full release.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640270?t=1773316437","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3640270?t=1773316437","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/dbadd507654a074ecece18d2cf5e7caaec92b031/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773316437","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/dbadd507654a074ecece18d2cf5e7caaec92b031/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773316437","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4446580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hunter\u2019s Hand</i></strong> is a <strong>turn-based tactical roguelike deckbuilder</strong> set in a dark fantasy world slowly coming apart at the seams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a hunter you travel across corrupted lands, uncovering clues and building a deck capable of confronting the ancient forces stirring beneath the surface. Each run unfolds across branching paths filled with combat encounters, strange events, and relics that reshape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rising <strong>Threat</strong> draws the attention of something far older than the lands you walk through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/4f4338fcbf8cda368dfc490e07da1da6.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/4f4338fcbf8cda368dfc490e07da1da6.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/4f4338fcbf8cda368dfc490e07da1da6.mp4?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunter\u2019s Hand is built around deliberate, combo-driven combat where the order of your cards can determine survival. Manage your resources, chain abilities together, and adapt your deck to survive increasingly dangerous encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/066fc8769d76d4be0e97ffe1c264e765.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/066fc8769d76d4be0e97ffe1c264e765.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/066fc8769d76d4be0e97ffe1c264e765.mp4?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck during each run using a wide pool of cards and relics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New combinations emerge as you experiment with different strategies, allowing each playthrough to evolve in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/e4fb7cfe73c7255a476e3f0426e8d0c2.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/e4fb7cfe73c7255a476e3f0426e8d0c2.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/e4fb7cfe73c7255a476e3f0426e8d0c2.mp4?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Branching Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across procedurally generated maps where every path presents different risks and opportunities. Choose carefully between battles, events, and hidden encounters as you prepare for what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/3dd30ed46680900a2eae17d28f0a8594.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/3dd30ed46680900a2eae17d28f0a8594.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/3dd30ed46680900a2eae17d28f0a8594.mp4?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Threat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues discovered during your journey increase the world\u2019s <strong>Threat level</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push too far and the Ancient will reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it does, you must be ready.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/1ba15fb8cf86fad6ba7ed03b97c670f4.poster.avif?t=1773316437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/extras/1ba15fb8cf86fad6ba7ed03b97c670f4.webm?t=1773316437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dark Fantasy World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore corrupted regions where ancient forces have begun to seep into the world. Each biome introduces new enemies, relics, and challenges as the hunt grows more dangerous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable classes and subclasses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large card and relic pools with evolving strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several biomes with unique enemies and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Ancient boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta progression and unlockable content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulty modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily runs and challenges</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Hunt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <strong>Hunter\u2019s Hand</strong> to follow development and prepare for the full release.</p>","developers":["Pixel Moon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640270/28af8ec0f987929188c27fbe8893cfda76172ed6/header.jpg?t=1773316437","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3640270/1208851616/f80c34052c757a5048c3b3b5e46b5b60d20f6925/1773316102/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773316436","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3640270/1208851616/f80c34052c757a5048c3b3b5e46b5b60d20f6925/1773316102/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773316436","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3640270/1208851616/f80c34052c757a5048c3b3b5e46b5b60d20f6925/1773316102/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773316436","id":257294409,"name":"Hunter's Hand Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257294409/c674c55cbc